(Section 1: Medical Research) Tj T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL T*
/F1 11 Tf 15 TL
(The medical research division completed the second phase of its trial for XR-472, an) Tj T*
(experimental treatment for chronic migraine. Of the 340 patients enrolled, 61% reported at) Tj T*
(least a 50% drop in monthly migraine days after twelve weeks. Side effects were mild and) Tj T*
(mostly limited to drowsiness during the first week. The division plans to start the third) Tj T*
(phase in the spring, pending approval from the review board. A partnership with two) Tj T*
(university hospitals will double the number of trial sites.) Tj T*
