(The software team rebuilt the patient data platform on a new event-driven architecture.) Tj T*
(Average page load time fell from 2.8 seconds to 0.9 seconds, and the platform handled a peak) Tj T*
(of 12,000 requests per minute without errors. The team moved all services to automated) Tj T*
